>有台灣網友發起「競選廣告與本人不符的比賽」，吸引不少民眾貼圖留言。（Threads@dragong919截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有台灣網友發起「競選廣告與本人不符的比賽」，吸引不少民眾貼圖留言。（Threads@dragong919截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182384543282237440457018.jpeg/Cp2DZAZCkUwi0zM0pzhV86Ci5tQHEBrPP36A5D9-gOQ\"/><figcaption>有台灣網友發起「競選廣告與本人不符的比賽」，吸引不少民眾貼圖留言。（Threads@dragong919截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有台灣網友發起「競選廣告與本人不符的比賽」，吸引不少民眾貼圖留言。（Threads@dragong919截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182384545555681280789465.jpeg/CyIWXJxhdjvExc4UETQ-Wfx9hYpD6gT_gXIZwYFyGcE\"/><figcaption>有台灣網友發起「競選廣告與本人不符的比賽」，吸引不少民眾貼圖留言。（Threads@dragong919截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>指沈伯洋無人機造勢要300萬 藍粉專：總統級資源在選市長</p><p>「洋流祭」應援毛巾遭嫌貴 網紅反問：把我們小水滴當塑膠嗎</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:53:27.486245+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3420,"images":39,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:07:01.029220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:53.393920+00:00","content_hash":"5c45acfd452273ab7b5fa0d875e6c5b8f4b36987a25ba89331dfd0b0c8fae12c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}